let __v_1946 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"It is rarely the stick or the pendant they are refusing - it is being the sort of person who needs one. Offer two so there is a choice: a plain stick rather than a hospital one, a wrist alarm instead of the pendant, the frame for the walk to the shop only. And let the GP or an occupational therapist say it, because from them it is advice and from you it is fuss.\",\"Then give them something to choose between rather than something to agree to. The council's occupational therapist will come out free and bring the options with them, and the one they picked themselves is the one they will use.\",\"A hearing aid, a stick and an alarm all say the same thing out loud - that they are older than they were - and that is the bit being refused. Ask what they would take: something that does not look medical, only for the parts they find hard, and suggested by somebody other than you.\"]}")?;
