let __v_4031 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Clammy is a cold sweat rather than being too warm. Have you eaten anything today?\",\"Get sat down and have something sweet if you have not eaten in a while. Does it come with feeling dizzy?\",\"That is usually your body working hard at something: a fever coming on, low blood sugar or a shock. Is it just your hands, or all over?\",\"Wash your hands and sit somewhere cool for a minute - has this come on today, or is it something you get? Cool water and a sit-down is the thing that helps most.\",\"Cold and clammy with the room at a normal temperature is worth taking slowly. Sit down, have a drink, and if you feel faint or muddled with it, ring 111.\"]}")?;
frame.store("BODY_CLAMMY", __v_4031.clone())?;
let __v_4032 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Pale usually means something is going round, or you have not eaten. Have you had anything today?\",\"Sit down and have a drink, then something to eat - did it come on suddenly, or have you been like this a while?\",\"Grey and washed out with it is worth getting looked at rather than waiting. Is there any dizziness with it?\",\"Has anyone said you look pale, or does it just feel like it? Pale with a bug is normal enough; pale and dizzy is the one to get seen.\",\"Put your feet up for ten minutes and have something with sugar in it. If you are clammy or muddled with it, get seen today.\"]}")?;
frame.store("BODY_PALE", __v_4032.clone())?;
let __v_4033 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Bloated usually settles if you go easy on salt and fizzy drinks for a day. Is it worse after eating?\",\"Puffy ankles and hands are worth getting checked if it is new. Is it just your stomach, or your ankles too?\",\"That is your body holding water. Drink more rather than less and cut the salt for a few days - does it ease overnight?\",\"Which bit is puffy? After a big meal and a late night it is nothing, but swelling that stays is worth a look.\",\"Go steady with salt and fizz and see if it settles by tomorrow. Is it tender with it?\"]}")?;
frame.store("BODY_PUFFY", __v_4033.clone())?;
